WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.234
AI did not

00:00:01.046 --> 00:00:02.543
start in 2022

00:00:03.078 --> 00:00:04.233
The story starts

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:05.507
in eighteen forty-three

00:00:05.613 --> 00:00:06.804
when Ada Lovelace

00:00:06.616 --> 00:00:07.818
saw that Babbage's

00:00:07.642 --> 00:00:08.997
Analytical Engine could

00:00:08.809 --> 00:00:09.858
work on symbols

00:00:09.918 --> 00:00:10.813
not just on

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:11.368
numbers

00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:13.175
The phrase artificial

00:00:12.987 --> 00:00:14.425
intelligence was named

00:00:14.237 --> 00:00:15.710
in nineteen fifty-five

00:00:15.817 --> 00:00:16.630
and the Dartmouth

00:00:16.442 --> 00:00:17.715
workshop followed in

00:00:17.527 --> 00:00:18.435
the summer of

00:00:18.246 --> 00:00:19.649
nineteen fifty-six

00:00:20.174 --> 00:00:21.117
Deep Blue beat

00:00:20.929 --> 00:00:22.391
Kasparov in nineteen

00:00:22.202 --> 00:00:23.074
ninety-seven

00:00:23.264 --> 00:00:24.383
AlexNet took off

00:00:24.195 --> 00:00:25.256
in twenty twelve

00:00:25.363 --> 00:00:27.096
and ChatGPT arrived

00:00:26.907 --> 00:00:27.791
on the thirtieth

00:00:27.615 --> 00:00:28.853
of November twenty

00:00:28.665 --> 00:00:29.490
twenty-two

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.044
Full story on

00:00:30.855 --> 00:00:31.751
the dashboard
